pe":"paragraph","text":"あの頃の自分からしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えられないことです(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は、お父さんとお母さんのそばに居れないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうしていつも一緒に見ていたテレビに出れて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気な姿を見せることができて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、ほんと幸せ者だなって感謝です(*^_^*)えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、こういう活動が出来るように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りますっ(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演者のみなさまも本当に優しくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う御座いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この模様は、８月２０日(月)の夜７時～で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、お楽しみにっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、この手は誰でしょ～？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/05/9474661/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9902":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近仕事がOFFだったので\n実家に帰ってました。\n1人暮らしは寂しいと\nつくづく思いました(´;ω;`)おん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってお昼頃まで寝て起きても\nモカたんがいつのまにか\n一緒に寝てるんだもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーもう幸せ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/19/9695813/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モカたんありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日はママとお出かけ\nしててトーストを発見♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/19/9695813/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上にはちみつかかってて\n凄く美味しかった( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんと今度食べにいこう～\nって約束してたけど先食べちゃった\n(´;ω;`)ごめんよ。許しておくれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、絶対食べに行こうね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ブームくるかな？\nエッグスンの次はこれかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かろってぃーとかも\n食べてた気がした。え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみたんもぜひぜひ\n食べに行ってみてね♡\nあ、ちなみにはちみつの\nおかわり出来ますよ( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/19/9695813/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！やばい。牛乳の賞味期限が...\n13日だw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2120":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、間違えた。\nこんべいしょんだった（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の事を振り返ると、夢だったんじゃないかってくらいあっという間で幸せな時間だった。。。\nファンの皆さんの声援が胸に響いて涙腺が緩んでね、ななみんと始まる一分前くらいに、『やばいやばいまだ始まってないのに涙出ちゃうよぉ(;_;)』って２人でたえてました（笑）\nあみ達は「サザエさんの１０年後」という小劇をやったんですけど、\n正直歌のチーム、トークのチーム、アイドルのチームの後にサザエさんやるのはかなり根性がいりました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも多分一生の中でマスオさんの１０年後をやるのは今回が最初で最後だろうと思い、全力でマスオさん演じました(∋_∈)!!!伝わったかなぁ～……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後は反省点だらけでちょっぴり落ち込んでたけど、ハイタッチ会の時、「あみあみ!!!」って声を掛けてくださる方もいて、\nもう本当に嬉しくて、多分あの時は私最高の笑顔だったと思う（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもこんなあみを応援していただけたら、嬉しいな(*^o^*)\n頑張るから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/01/111126_231801.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/01/111129_172201.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18260":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"風が気持ちの良い季節に\nなってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなニット暑苦しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかの私服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもちょっと暑苦しい？\nあれ？これ、載せたっけ、あれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、\nお父さんが炊き込みご飯を\n作ってくれました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじいちゃんが採ってきた筍！\n家の竹やぶにはえてたんだって！\nおじいちゃんはいつも新鮮な野菜を\nお家に届けてくれます。\n野菜美味しいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤家は普段、炊き込みご飯を\n作らないので感動しちゃった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだもおにぎりにして\n撮影場に持って行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また作ってほしい\nって頼んだら今から作るって笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメ載ってます！\n堀未央奈×伊藤万理華\nペアグラビア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たらなるほど、ってなるかなあ\nしっくりきてるかしら！\n楽しんでました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材でもあるように\n撮影中ずっとボケてました。\n毎回そうです、\nもちろん一人か二人くらい\nじゃないとできないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうしてないと落ち着かないみたい。\n笑わせるの好きなのかな、、？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せられる写真って\n全部綺麗に撮ってもらったもの\nばかりだから載せられないのが残念。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、バレッタのナタリーグラビアでは\nふざけてるところも載ってる！\n本当にいつもあんな感じよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも綺麗に撮ってもらえるって幸せ。\nやっぱり撮影は楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにヒール高かったの。\nガニ股で歩いてたら\nスタッフさんに笑われた笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月9日はBOMB発売！\n日芽香と飛鳥と私の3人です。\nこちらもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前にアンダーライブ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキが止まらねえ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/03/4309075/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おれ、がんばる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-38981":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画アクション～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/06/06/0387522/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/06/06/0387522/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"単独表紙です（ ;  